{"speciesId":157,"names":{"fr":"Typhlosion","es":"Typhlosion","en":"Typhlosion","ja":"バクフーン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"If its rage peaks, it becomes so hot that anything that touches it will instantly go up in flames."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It has a secret, devastating move. It rubs its blaz­ ing fur together to cause huge explosions."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"When heat from its body causes the air around it to shimmer, this is a sign that it is ready to battle."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"TYPHLOSION obscures itself behind a shimmering heat haze that it creates using its intensely hot flames. This POKéMON creates blazing explosive blasts that burn everything to cinders."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"TYPHLOSION obscures itself behind a shimmering heat haze that it creates using its intensely hot flames. This POKéMON creates blazing explosive blasts that burn everything to cinders."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It can hide behind a shimmering heat haze that it creates using its intense flames. TYPHLOSION create blazing explosive blasts that burn everything to cinders."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It has a secret, devastating move. It rubs its blazing fur together to cause huge explosions."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"If its rage peaks, it becomes so hot that anything that touches it will instantly go up in flames."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It attacks using blasts of fire. It creates heat shimmers with intense fire to hide itself."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It attacks using blasts of fire. It creates heat shimmers with intense fire to hide itself."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It attacks using blasts of fire. It creates heat shimmers with intense fire to hide itself."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"If its rage peaks, it becomes so hot that anything that touches it will instantly go up in flames."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It has a secret, devastating move. It rubs its blazing fur together to cause huge explosions."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il attaque en projetant des flammes. Il se dissimule derrière les vagues de chaleur qu’il produit."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It attacks using blasts of fire. It creates heat shimmers with intense fire to hide itself."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il attaque en projetant des flammes. Il se dissimule derrière les vagues de chaleur qu’il produit."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It attacks using blasts of fire. It creates heat shimmers with intense fire to hide itself."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It attacks using blasts of fire. It creates heat shimmers with intense fire to hide itself."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It attacks using blasts of fire. It creates heat shimmers with intense fire to hide itself."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Quand il est furieux, il devient si chaud que tout ce qu’il touche s’enflamme instantanément."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Si su furia crece, se calienta tanto que cualquier cosa que toque se prenderá al instante."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"If its rage peaks, it becomes so hot that anything that touches it will instantly go up in flames."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"怒りが 最高潮のとき 触ったもの すべて 一瞬で 燃え上がらせるほどに 熱い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il a un coup secret dévastateur. En frottant sa fourrure ardente, il crée une forte explosion."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Tiene una habilidad secreta y devastadora. Causa explosiones al frotar su pelaje."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It has a secret, devastating move. It rubs its blazing fur together to cause huge explosions."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"燃えさかる 体毛を こすり合わせ 爆風を 起こして 攻撃す